ign\u002Fdb-sync",{"title":164,"path":224,"stem":225},"\u002Fdesign\u002Fdispatch-center","9.design\u002Fdispatch-center",{"title":227,"path":228,"stem":229},"Employee Management","\u002Fdesign\u002Femployee-management","9.design\u002Femployee-management",{"title":231,"path":232,"stem":233},"Player Tracker Rework","\u002Fdesign\u002Fplayer-tracker-rework","9.design\u002Fplayer-tracker-rework",{"title":235,"path":236,"stem":237},"Qualifications","\u002Fdesign\u002Fqualifications","9.design\u002Fqualifications",{"id":239,"title":45,"body":240,"description":246,"extension":314,"links":315,"meta":316,"navigation":317,"path":46,"redirect":315,"seo":318,"stem":47,"__hash__":319},"content_en\u002F1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F1.methods.md",{"type":241,"value":242,"toc":308},"minimark",[243,247,269,274,292,296,302],[244,245,246],"p",{},"Choose the installation path that fits your environment, whether you want managed hosting with FiveNet Cloud or a self-hosted deployment with Docker or Kubernetes.",[248,249,252],"callout",{"color":250,"icon":251},"secondary","i-mdi-information",[244,253,254,258,259,264,265,268],{},[255,256,257],"strong",{},"Important",": Self-hosting FiveNet requires intermediate knowledge of Docker or Kubernetes. For professional support, simplified setup, or managed hosting, we recommend using ",[260,261,263],"a",{"href":262},"cloud","FiveNet Cloud",".",[266,267],"br",{},"\nPlease ensure you have sufficient experience with these technologies before attempting installation. Community-based support is available for installation and configuration.",[270,271,273],"h2",{"id":272},"self-hosted","Self-hosted",[275,276,277,285],"card-group",{},[278,279,282],"card",{"icon":280,"title":281,"to":51},"i-mdi-docker","Docker",[244,283,284],{},"Learn how to set up FiveNet using Docker and the Docker Compose plugin.",[278,286,289],{"icon":287,"title":288,"to":55},"i-mdi-kubernetes","Kubernetes",[244,290,291],{},"Deploy FiveNet on Kubernetes using our Helm Chart.",[270,293,295],{"id":294},"cloud-hosted","Cloud-hosted",[244,297,298,299,264],{},"For those who prefer a hassle-free experience, FiveNet Cloud offers a streamlined way to run FiveNet for your roleplay server. Learn more on the ",[260,300,301],{"href":262},"Cloud info page",[278,303,305],{"icon":304,"title":263,"to":11},"i-mdi-cloud",[244,306,307],{},"Get started with FiveNet Cloud for a fully managed solution, eliminating the need for manual setup and maintenance. Perfect for those who want to focus on their roleplay server without worrying about infrastructure.",{"title":309,"searchDepth":310,"depth":310,"links":311},"",2,[312,313],{"id":272,"depth":310,"text":273},{"id":294,"depth":310,"text":295},"md",null,{},true,{"title":45,"description":246},"GTx_J8DS6z83h5Ab-A0j3tlRPq5-OLcdUU_rgT_TBzo",1795592557782,"e666030a-7717-4390-a061-5f12bacb18ad"]